    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a first-person horror inspired by real-life haunted tunnels. You'll explore a sealed tunnel filled with fear and tension. Can you make it out alive and find your way back home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through a sealed tunnel rumored to harbor something sinister, and uncover the truth that lies beyond the terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short first-person walking simulator that offers a similar feeling to actually testing your courage in a haunted location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple endings to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 - 30 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and Video Content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions on streaming or creating video content for this game. Feel free to enjoy and share!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adjust various settings from the options menu, including graphics and mouse sensitivity:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbWindowed Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbQuality Settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMouse Sensitivity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFlashlight Brightness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbVolume Adjustments</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a first-person horror inspired by real-life haunted tunnels. You'll explore a sealed tunnel filled with fear and tension. Can you make it out alive and find your way back home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through a sealed tunnel rumored to harbor something sinister, and uncover the truth that lies beyond the terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short first-person walking simulator that offers a similar feeling to actually testing your courage in a haunted location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple endings to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 - 30 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and Video Content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions on streaming or creating video content for this game. Feel free to enjoy and share!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adjust various settings from the options menu, including graphics and mouse sensitivity:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbWindowed Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbQuality Settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMouse Sensitivity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFlashlight Brightness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbVolume Adjustments</p>",
